    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bSwipe. Upgrade. Expand.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Celldom is the original web hit, now on Steam.\u200b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swipe across a grid of cells to generate income, upgrade individual cells, and expand your board. Unlock dashers for passive income and rebirth to boost your earnings further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version includes Steam achievements, leaderboards, and cloud saves.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're revisiting or just discovering it, Celldom offers a straightforward, engaging idle experience.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong>\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple swipe-based incremental gameplay\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your board and upgrade the cells for more value\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dashers for passive income</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebirth system for progression\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements and leaderboards\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully playable</strong>\u00a0on <strong>Steam Deck</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bSwipe. Upgrade. Expand.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Celldom is the original web hit, now on Steam.\u200b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swipe across a grid of cells to generate income, upgrade individual cells, and expand your board. Unlock dashers for passive income and rebirth to boost your earnings further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version includes Steam achievements, leaderboards, and cloud saves.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're revisiting or just discovering it, Celldom offers a straightforward, engaging idle experience.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong>\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple swipe-based incremental gameplay\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your board and upgrade the cells for more value\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dashers for passive income</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebirth system for progression\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements and leaderboards\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully playable</strong>\u00a0on <strong>Steam Deck</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The popular webgame comes to Steam!\u00a0Celldom is a different type of clicker game where you swipe over a &quot;board&quot; to earn income instead of clicking. Spend money on upgrading your board, upgrade idle earnings, unlock dashers and rebirth to start over again with permanent boosts.",
